asya lakṣārddha jāpena rudratulyo bhavennaraḥ ||

nigrahānugrahe śaktaḥ saṃbhavennānyathā suta |
homastu japavat kāmaḥ śastrajāpeṣu sarvasu ||

tadāsamartho bhavati sādhakaḥ siddhi sādhane |
divyāntarīkṣabhaumānāṃ mutpātānāṃ vimardane ||

nāśayet nātrasaṃdehaḥ namaḥ sūryodaye yathā |
guggulena ghṛtenaiva sahasrāhuti yogataḥ ||

nāsayet sarvaduritānastrarājaprabhāvataḥ |
ya idaṃ paṭhate nityaṃ sakṛdvighnai na bādhyate ||

