tārakolkāni pāne ca dhūmaketu nidarśane ||

nīhāreti valavāyostathākālapravarṣaṇe |
hakalaṃ sākhamāṃḍukamārjāraścāntare kṛte ||

anadhyā yogate sarpa trirātraṃ dānapūjanaṃ |
candrārka grahaṇe tadvat tathā śakron saveṣṭa ca ||

pavitrārohaṇe saptakartavyaṃ dānapūjanaṃ |
athānyā lakṣaṇakān vakṣye saṃkṣepaṇāvadhāraya ||

