gāṅgaṃ padaṃ tatonte (* * * * * * * ?) 
nyaset ||

mahākāli padaṃ paścāt māṃsaśoṇitabhojani |
raktakṛṣṇamukhī devi padaṃ cāṣṭākṣaraṃ nyaset ||

māmapaśyaṃ tu tasyāṃte mānuṣāśca padaṃ tataḥ |
svāhāntaṃ caiva vikhyā(?)yā kartavyantārakāntataḥ ||

lakṣajāpaṃ prakartavyaṃ sa varṇājya tu homayet |
daśāṃśena mahāsena siddhā karmakarī bhavet ||

