avatareti padaṃ dveṣo he varṇaṃ tadanantaraṃ |
adarśapadamanyacca tathā darśāvahirnyaset ||

cauraṃ gṛhṇāpaya padantathā vārṣpaya paścimaṃ |
anena mantra mukhyena kumāryājñānamācaret ||

tatonya divase mantrī snātvā karma samācaret |
svavāmāṅguṣṭhamajñāna purā caiva vimarddhayet ||

